            nursing: ['Lethargic and disoriented x2; skin tents; mucous membranes dry; HR 112 and BP 96/54 on arrival.', 'Foley placed for hourly urine output; aspiration precautions; NPO until swallow screen passed.', 'Frequent vitals, neuro checks every 2 hours, bed alarm, pressure injury prevention.', 'Lung sounds and work of breathing assessed every 2 hours during large-volume fluids.'],
